,{"name":"initial event ledger","type":"HR_H3_EVENT_LEDGER","links":[29]},{"name":"event ledger JSON","type":"STRING","links":null},{"name":"validation report","type":"STRING","links":null},{"name":"planned frames","type":"INT","links":null}],"widgets_values":["Heman, Tila, the tiger, and Tiamat must keep the exact identities and clothing shown in the five connected reference pictures.\n\nFirst, Heman and Tila ride the tiger rapidly through dense jungle toward the ancient overgrown pyramid. Use a rear three-quarter tracking view, not a flat side profile. End with the dark entrance centered ahead; they have not entered yet.\n\nCut to a frontal low-angle wide view from inside the temple. The tiger crosses the threshold exactly once and runs fully inside. End with the jungle behind them; Heman has not pulled the harness yet.\n\nCut closer. Heman pulls the harness exactly once. The tiger roars, lowers its body, and begins skidding on stone. End while the tiger is already sliding; do not complete the stop yet.\n\nCut to a wide diagonal interior view. Continue the existing skid without restarting it. Dust, smoke, and scrape marks trail behind the tiger until it comes to a complete stop. Heman and Tila remain mounted.\n\nCut once to a three-quarter close-up of Tila. She hears a sound from camera-right, points once, and says: <d>[English] I heard something coming from that direction, He-Man!</d> Do not repeat the gesture or line.\n\nCut to a static medium-wide interior shot. Heman dismounts exactly once and cautiously walks camera-right while Tila stays mounted and the tiger remains stopped.\n\nCut to a frontal medium close-up of Heman. Dark energy appears and the room begins shaking. Heman says: <d>[English] There's a weird and evil dark energy in this place.</d> Debris begins falling, then he says: <d>[English] I don't like this!</d> Each line occurs once.\n\nCut to Tila. She closes her eyes and shields her head from debris. A dragon roar sounds beyond the closed gate. Tila says: <d>[English] What the fuck was that?</d> Do not reveal the dragon yet.\n\nCut to a wide low-angle shot from behind the heroes facing the gate. The gate collapses once; dark fog fills the opening. Tiamat's central red head emerges for the first time, followed by the other heads.\n\nContinue the established gate view and slowly zoom out once to reveal Tiamat's full scale. The central head lowers toward the heroes. Do not repeat the gate collapse or first emergence.\n\nCut to a medium-wide oblique shot. Heman pivots once and sprints camera-left, shouting: <d>[English] Fuck this!</d> Tila and the tiger pause and look at each other once.\n\nCut to the first lateral chase tracking shot. The tiger begins galloping after Heman with Tila mounted. Tila shouts: <d>[English] Wait for us, you jackass!</d> All heroes continue in one direction; do not restart the chase.",26.042,24.0,"cinematic realism, live action, Caravaggio chiaroscuro, Kodak 35mm grain","medium","strict","en"],"widgets_values_named":{"story":"Heman, Tila, the tiger, and Tiamat must keep the exact identities and clothing shown in the five connected reference pictures.\n\nFirst, Heman and Tila ride the tiger rapidly through dense jungle toward the ancient overgrown pyramid. Use a rear three-quarter tracking view, not a flat side profile. End with the dark entrance centered ahead; they have not entered yet.\n\nCut to a frontal low-angle wide view from inside the temple. The tiger crosses the threshold exactly once and runs fully inside. End with the jungle behind them; Heman has not pulled the harness yet.\n\nCut closer. Heman pulls the harness exactly once. The tiger roars, lowers its body, and begins skidding on stone. End while the tiger is already sliding; do not complete the stop yet.\n\nCut to a wide diagonal interior view. Continue the existing skid without restarting it. Dust, smoke, and scrape marks trail behind the tiger until it comes to a complete stop. Heman and Tila remain mounted.\n\nCut once to a three-quarter close-up of Tila. She hears a sound from camera-right, points once, and says: <d>[English] I heard something coming from that direction, He-Man!</d> Do not repeat the gesture or line.\n\nCut to a static medium-wide interior shot. Heman dismounts exactly once and cautiously walks camera-right while Tila stays mounted and the tiger remains stopped.\n\nCut to a frontal medium close-up of Heman. Dark energy appears and the room begins shaking. Heman says: <d>[English] There's a weird and evil dark energy in this place.</d> Debris begins falling, then he says: <d>[English] I don't like this!</d> Each line occurs once.\n\nCut to Tila. She closes her eyes and shields her head from debris. A dragon roar sounds beyond the closed gate. Tila says: <d>[English] What the fuck was that?</d> Do not reveal the dragon yet.\n\nCut to a wide low-angle shot from behind the heroes facing the gate. The gate collapses once; dark fog fills the opening. Tiamat's central red head emerges for the first time, followed by the other heads.\n\nContinue the established gate view and slowly zoom out once to reveal Tiamat's full scale. The central head lowers toward the heroes. Do not repeat the gate collapse or first emergence.\n\nCut to a medium-wide oblique shot. Heman pivots once and sprints camera-left, shouting: <d>[English] Fuck this!</d> Tila and the tiger pause and look at each other once.\n\nCut to the first lateral chase tracking shot. The tiger begins galloping after Heman with Tila mounted. Tila shouts: <d>[English] Wait for us, you jackass!</d> All heroes continue in one direction; do not restart the chase.","duration_seconds":26.042,"fps":24.0,"style":"cinematic realism, live action, Caravaggio chiaroscuro, Kodak 35mm grain","shot_density":"medium","continuity_mode":"strict","prompt_lang":"en"},"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"HRH3PromptSkillCompiler"}},{"id":2603,"type":"HRMiniMaxH3ReferenceConditioning","pos":[200,750],"size":[470,500],"flags":{},"order":23,"